      "evidence": "subprocess.run(..., check=True)",
      "llm_reasoning": "The code assumes the directory is a valid git repository. If it is not, subprocess.CalledProcessError will be raised, potentially crashing the application or leaking stack traces.",
      "suggested_fix": "Wrap subprocess calls in a try-except block to handle CalledProcessError and provide meaningful error messages."
